---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<BaseLayout title="Patch v0.108.0">
  <div class="page-header">
    <h1>v0.108.0 Update</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">Changes from v0.107.1 &rarr; v0.108.0 &mdash; derived from decompiled game data</p>
  </div>

  <div style="max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;">

    <p class="desc-text">
      The headline of v0.108.0 is a batch of <strong>15 new multiplayer cards</strong> &mdash; every one of them
      references other players ("Give another player 5 Strength", "ALL players draw 2 cards", "EVERYONE'S 0-cost
      Attacks deal 3 additional damage"), building out the co-op mode's card pool across all five characters plus
      Colorless. Eight new powers support them. Alongside that comes a round of card balance changes (including
      reworks of <a href={`${base}cards/outbreak/`}>Outbreak</a> and <a href={`${base}cards/fuel/`}>Fuel</a>, and a
      systemic change from "double damage" effects to percentage-based ones), two rarity swaps, and a full
      re-render of the card art at visibly higher quality &mdash; nearly every card image in the game changed.
    </p>

    <!-- ═══════════════════════════════ -->
    <!-- NEW MULTIPLAYER CARDS           -->
    <!-- ═══════════════════════════════ -->
    <h2 class="section-heading" id="new-cards" style="margin-top: 2rem;">New Multiplayer Cards</h2>

    <table class="stat-table">
      <thead><tr><th>Card</th><th>Character</th><th>Rarity</th><th>Effect</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><a href={`${base}cards/blaze/`}>Blaze</a></td><td>Ironclad</td><td>Uncommon</td><td>2 ⚡ — Give another player 5 (7) Strength.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href={`${base}cards/midnight/`}>Midnight</a></td><td>Ironclad</td><td>Rare</td><td>12 ⚡ — Deal 99 (120) damage. Costs 1 less for each card Exhausted this combat by ANYONE.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href={`${base}cards/outrage/`}>Outrage</a></td><td>Ironclad</td><td>Uncommon</td><td>0 ⚡ — Deal 9 (13) damage. Add a copy of this card into EVERYONE'S Discard Pile.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href={`${base}cards/blade-symphony/`}>Blade Symphony</a></td><td>Silent</td><td>Uncommon</td><td>1 ⚡ — Add 2 (3) Shivs to ALL players' Hands.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href={`${base}cards/concoct/`}>Concoct</a></td><td>Silent</td><td>Uncommon</td><td>0 ⚡ — Choose another player. Their unblocked Attacks apply 3 (4) Poison this turn.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href={`${base}cards/fade/`}>Fade</a></td><td>Silent</td><td>Uncommon</td><td>0 ⚡ — Another player gains 6 (9) Dexterity this turn.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href={`${base}cards/hibernate/`}>Hibernate</a></td><td>Defect</td><td>Uncommon</td><td>2 ⚡ — This turn your Frost grants ALL allies Block. Channel 2 (3) Frost.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href={`${base}cards/imitation-learning/`}>Imitation Learning</a></td><td>Defect</td><td>Rare</td><td>1 ⚡ — The next 2 (3) times a chosen player plays a Power, you play a copy.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href={`${base}cards/one-for-all/`}>One for All</a></td><td>Defect</td><td>Rare</td><td>1 ⚡ — EVERYONE'S 0-cost Attacks deal 3 (4) additional damage.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href={`${base}cards/cacophony/`}>Cacophony</a></td><td>Necrobinder</td><td>Rare</td><td>2 ⚡ — Every 33 cards drawn by ALL players, deal 66 (99) damage to a random enemy.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href={`${base}cards/soulbound/`}>Soulbound</a></td><td>Necrobinder</td><td>Uncommon</td><td>1 ⚡ — Choose an ally. Whenever you create a Soul, add a Soul to their Draw Pile.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href={`${base}cards/underworld/`}>Underworld</a></td><td>Necrobinder</td><td>Uncommon</td><td>2 ⚡ — Whenever other players deal attack damage this turn, apply that much Doom.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href={`${base}cards/constellation/`}>Constellation</a></td><td>Regent</td><td>Uncommon</td><td>0 ⚡ — Another player draws 1 card, gains 1 Energy, and gains 9 (12) Block.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href={`${base}cards/plot/`}>Plot</a></td><td>Regent</td><td>Uncommon</td><td>1 ⚡ — Next turn, ALL players draw 2 (3) cards.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href={`${base}cards/the-ball/`}>The Ball</a></td><td>Colorless</td><td>Uncommon</td><td>1 ⚡ — Deal 10 damage. Grows by 15 (25) this combat and passes to a random ally.</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <p class="desc-text" style="font-size: 0.9rem;">
      Eight new powers back these cards: Cacophony, Concoct, Fade, Hibernate, Imitation Learning, One for All,
      Soulbound, and Underworld.
    </p>

    <!-- ═══════════════════════════════ -->
    <!-- REWORKS                         -->
    <!-- ═══════════════════════════════ -->
    <h2 class="section-heading" id="reworks" style="margin-top: 2rem;">Reworks</h2>

    <table class="stat-table">
      <thead><tr><th>Card</th><th>Before</th><th>After</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td><a href={`${base}cards/outbreak/`}>Outbreak</a></td>
          <td>Every 3 times you apply Poison, deal 11 (15) damage to ALL enemies.</td>
          <td><strong>Whenever</strong> you apply Poison, deal 3 (4) damage to ALL enemies.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><a href={`${base}cards/fuel/`}>Fuel</a> <em>(Token)</em></td>
          <td>Gain 1 Energy. Draw 1 (2) card.</td>
          <td>Gain 1 (2) Energy &mdash; the card draw is gone; the upgrade now grants Energy.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><a href={`${base}cards/tank/`}>Tank</a></td>
          <td>Take double damage; allies take half damage.</td>
          <td>Percentage-based: take 50% more damage; allies take 50% less.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><a href={`${base}cards/tracking/`}>Tracking</a></td>
          <td>Weak enemies take double damage from Attacks.</td>
          <td>Weak enemies take 50% more damage from Attacks.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><a href={`${base}cards/helix-drill/`}>Helix Drill</a></td>
          <td>Counts Energy "previously spent this turn".</td>
          <td>Counts Energy "spent on <strong>other cards</strong> this turn".</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <p class="desc-text" style="font-size: 0.9rem;">
      The Tank/Tracking changes are part of a systemic shift: the underlying Guarded, Tank, and Tracking powers all
      moved from "double/half damage" to configurable percentages (currently 50%).
    </p>

    <!-- ═══════════════════════════════ -->
    <!-- BALANCE CHANGES                 -->
    <!-- ═══════════════════════════════ -->
    <h2 class="section-heading" id="balance" style="margin-top: 2rem;">Card Balance Changes</h2>

    <table class="stat-table">
      <thead><tr><th>Card</th><th>Change</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><a href={`${base}cards/devastate/`}>Devastate</a></td><td>Damage 30 (40) &rarr; <strong>35 (45)</strong></td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href={`${base}cards/flick-flack/`}>Flick-Flack</a></td><td>AoE damage 6 (8) &rarr; <strong>7 (9)</strong></td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href={`${base}cards/howl-from-beyond/`}>Howl from Beyond</a></td><td>AoE damage 16 (21) &rarr; <strong>18 (24)</strong></td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href={`${base}cards/momentum-strike/`}>Momentum Strike</a></td><td>Damage 10 (13) &rarr; <strong>11 (15)</strong></td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href={`${base}cards/reave/`}>Reave</a></td><td>Damage 9 (11) &rarr; <strong>10 (13)</strong></td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href={`${base}cards/haunt/`}>Haunt</a></td><td>HP loss per Soul 6 (8) &rarr; <strong>7 (9)</strong></td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href={`${base}cards/soul-storm/`}>Soul Storm</a></td><td>Bonus damage per Soul 2 (3) &rarr; <strong>4 (6)</strong></td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href={`${base}cards/setup-strike/`}>Setup Strike</a></td><td>Strength gain 2 (3) &rarr; <strong>3 (4)</strong></td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href={`${base}cards/anticipate/`}>Anticipate</a></td><td>Upgraded Dexterity 3 &rarr; <strong>4</strong></td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href={`${base}cards/colossus/`}>Colossus</a></td><td>Block 5 (8) &rarr; <strong>4 (7)</strong></td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href={`${base}cards/crimson-mantle/`}>Crimson Mantle</a></td><td>Block 8 (10) &rarr; <strong>7 (10)</strong></td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href={`${base}cards/minion-sacrifice/`}>Minion Sacrifice</a> <em>(Token)</em></td><td>Block 8 (11) &rarr; <strong>7 (10)</strong></td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href={`${base}cards/beacon-of-hope/`}>Beacon of Hope</a></td><td>Cost 1 &rarr; <strong>2</strong> Energy</td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href={`${base}cards/resonance/`}>Resonance</a></td><td>Star cost 3 &rarr; <strong>2</strong></td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href={`${base}cards/flanking/`}>Flanking</a></td><td>Rarity Uncommon &rarr; <strong>Rare</strong></td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href={`${base}cards/ignition/`}>Ignition</a></td><td>Rarity Rare &rarr; <strong>Uncommon</strong></td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href={`${base}cards/shatter/`}>Shatter</a></td><td>Gained <strong>Exhaust</strong></td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href={`${base}cards/legion-of-bone/`}>Legion of Bone</a></td><td>Lost <strong>Exhaust</strong></td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href={`${base}cards/shining-strike/`}>Shining Strike</a></td><td>Lost <strong>Exhaust</strong></td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <!-- ═══════════════════════════════ -->
    <!-- MONSTERS / RELICS / ENCOUNTERS  -->
    <!-- ═══════════════════════════════ -->
    <h2 class="section-heading" id="other" style="margin-top: 2rem;">Monsters, Relics &amp; Encounters</h2>

    <table class="stat-table">
      <thead><tr><th>Entity</th><th>Change</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><a href={`${base}monsters/torch-head-amalgam/`}>Torch Head Amalgam</a></td><td>Tackle damage 19 &rarr; <strong>22</strong> (both Tackle moves)</td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href={`${base}relics/divine-destiny/`}>Divine Destiny</a></td><td>Stars 6 &rarr; <strong>7</strong></td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href={`${base}relics/silken-tress/`}>Silken Tress</a></td><td>Description clarified ("the first card reward" &rarr; "your first card reward")</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Battleworn Dummy <em>(event encounter)</em></td><td>Split into three variants (V1/V2/V3) replacing the single encounter</td></tr>
        <tr><td><a href={`${base}encounters/strangler-and-friend/`}>Strangler and Friend</a> / <a href={`${base}encounters/overgrowth-flora/`}>Overgrowth Flora</a></td><td>Gained the <strong>Jaxfruit</strong> encounter tag (Strangler also gained <strong>Slimes</strong>)</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <!-- ═══════════════════════════════ -->
    <!-- ART & ENGINE                    -->
    <!-- ═══════════════════════════════ -->
    <h2 class="section-heading" id="art" style="margin-top: 2rem;">Art &amp; Engine</h2>

    <p class="desc-text">
      Nearly the entire card-art atlas was <strong>re-rendered at visibly higher quality</strong> this patch &mdash;
      side-by-side comparison shows sharper linework and redrawn details on hundreds of cards. The wiki's card
      images have been updated to match. New art also landed for several previously placeholder ("beta") cards,
      and new relic icons for Fishing Rod, Kaleidoscope, and Silken Tress.
    </p>

    <p class="desc-text" style="font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 1rem;">
      Event scripts were touched broadly this patch, but almost all of it is engine-level refactoring with no
      gameplay effect. One data-visible exception: Punch-Off's bonus combat rewards are now granted to the event
      owner rather than duplicated for every player &mdash; in line with the patch's multiplayer focus.
    </p>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>
